# Walkthrough - Enhanced Task AI Capabilities

I have upgraded the task system to support advanced date-based filtering and deeper AI intelligence for workload management.

## Key Enhancements

### 1. Advanced AI Task Filtering
The [search_tasks](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#89-157) AI tool now supports much more granular queries. The AI can now accurately resolve requests like:
- "Show me tasks due this week"
- "Are there any overdue tasks?"
- "What's due next Monday?"
- "Show me high priority tasks due before Friday"

### 2. Workload Intelligence
Added a new [get_task_stats](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#158-186) tool that allows the AI to provide a high-level summary of your current workload, including:
- Total pending tasks
- Count of overdue items
- Tasks due today and this week
- Priority breakdown

### 3. API Consistency
Updated the `/api/v1/tasks` endpoint with new [upcoming](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/tests/test_services/test_ai_task_tools.py#28-35) and [overdue](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/tests/test_services/test_ai_task_tools.py#23-27) filters, ensuring the UI has access to the same powerful filtering logic as the AI.

## Verification Results

### Automated Tests
Ran comprehensive unit tests for both the router and the AI tools:
- **Router Tests**: Verified CRUD and new filter parity.
- **AI Tool Tests**: Verified date-range logic, overdue detection, and stats calculation.

